## Why This Is Asked
This question tests the ability to architect a production-grade, multimodal NLP system that balances real-time performance with privacy requirements while supporting multilingual deployment.

## Key Concepts
- Multimodal fusion strategies and on-device inference
- Privacy-preserving cloud inference with encrypted fallback
- Latency budgeting and threshold calibration across languages
- Model explainability and fairness/drift monitoring

## Code Example
```javascript
function fuse(textModel, visualModel, audioModel) {
  // Attention-weighted fusion of modality scores
  const textScore = textModel.predict(textInput);
  const visualScore = visualModel.predict(videoFrames);
  const audioScore = audioModel.predict(audioStream);

  // Attention-based calibration head
  const weights = attentionLayer([textScore, visualScore, audioScore]);
  return weightedSum([textScore, visualScore, audioScore], weights);
}
```

